WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.218
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which punctuation ends the telling sentence “Ama has a

00:00:05.218 --> 00:00:05.576
book”?

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.162
The answer is: .. A full stop ends an ordinary telling sentence.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:15.545
Watch and read: For your habitual practice, ama does this every school day: read.

00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:17.156
What is the best answer?

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:23.148
The answer is: Ama reads.. Read the instruction carefully and choose the helpful or

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:23.879
correct response.
